ische doorverwijzingen, analytics, teamworkflows. De volledige functieset, zonder franje.</p></section>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d57fb629 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d57fb629\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ff8ef68 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"3ff8ef68\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<style>.d01-fpage{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 32px 32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:64px;}.d01-fgroup{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2.4fr;gap:48px;align-items:start;border-top:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);padding-top:32px;}.d01-fgroup-head{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;position:sticky;top:120px;}.d01-fgroup-id{font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B6470;}.d01-fgroup-id b{color:#0F8A5F;font-weight:500;}.d01-fgroup-name{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,44px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0A0E15;margin:0;}.d01-fgroup-name em{font-family:\"Newsreader\",Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:#5B6470;}.d01-fgroup-blurb{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#5B6470;margin:8px 0 0;max-width:32ch;}.d01-fcards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:0;border:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);}.d01-fcard{padding:28px 24px;border-right:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);background:#FAF7EC;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:240px;}.d01-fcard:nth-child(3n){border-right:0;}.d01-fcard:nth-child(n+4){border-top:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);}.d01-fcard-id{font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B6470;}.d01-fcard-title{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0A0E15;margin:0;}.d01-fcard-desc{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#5B6470;margin:0;}.d01-fcard-tag{align-self:flex-start;font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B6470;border:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);padding:4px 8px;margin-top:auto;}@media(max-width:1100px){.d01-fgroup{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;}.d01-fgroup-head{position:static;}}@media(max-width:900px){.d01-fcards{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.d01-fcard{border-right:0 !important;border-top:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);min-height:auto;}.d01-fcard:first-child{border-top:0;}.d01-fpage{padding:32px 20px;gap:40px;}}@media(max-width:1100px) and (min-width:901px){.d01-fcards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}.d01-fcard{border-right:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13) !important;border-top:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);}.d01-fcard:first-child,.d01-fcard:nth-child(2){border-top:0;}.d01-fcard:nth-child(2n){border-right:0 !important;}}.d01-fcta{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 32px 80px;}.d01-fcta-inner{border:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);background:#FAF7EC;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:48px;padding:48px;align-items:center;}.d01-fcta-kicker{font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B6470;margin-bottom:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;}.d01-fcta-kicker::before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#0F8A5F;}.d01-fcta-headline{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,44px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0A0E15;margin:0;}.d01-fcta-headline em{font-family:\"Newsreader\",Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:#5B6470;}.d01-fcta-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}.d01-fcta-actions a{font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:14px 24px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #0A0E15;transition:background .15s,color .15s,border-color .15s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;}.d01-fcta-primary{background:#0F8A5F;border-color:#0F8A5F;color:#FAF7EC;}.d01-fcta-primary:hover{background:#0A0E15;border-color:#0A0E15;}.d01-fcta-secondary{background:transparent;color:#0A0E15;border-color:rgba(10,14,21,0.20);}.d01-fcta-secondary:hover{border-color:#0A0E15;}@media(max-width:800px){.d01-fcta-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:32px 24px;gap:32px;}.d01-fcta{padding:24px 20px 48px;}}</style><div class=\"d01-fpage\"><section class=\"d01-fgroup\"><div class=\"d01-fgroup-head\"><span class=\"d01-fgroup-id\"><b>01</b> · Capability group</span><h2 class=\"d01-fgroup-name\">QR-code<em>beheer.</em></h2><p class=\"d01-fgroup-blurb\">De basis, goed uitgevoerd: bewerkbare codes, slimme doorverwijzingen, geschaalde aanmaak. Eén keer printen, oneindig hergebruiken.</p></div><div class=\"d01-fcards\"><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">01 · Editable</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Dynamische QR-codes</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Werk bestemmingen op elk moment bij zonder opnieuw te printen. Wijzig URL's, wissel landingspagina's, publiceer nieuwe aanbiedingen — de geprinte code verandert nooit.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Edit · Version</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">02 · Routing</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Slimme doorverwijzingen</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Routeer op apparaattype, browser, besturingssysteem, taal of eigen regels. Stuur iOS-gebruikers naar de App Store, Android naar Google Play en de rest naar een terugvaloptie.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Device · Rules</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">03 · Bulk</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Bulkgeneratie</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Genereer honderden unieke codes vanuit een CSV. Gebouwd voor productverpakkingen, campagnes op meerdere locaties en implementaties op evenementschaal.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">CSV · At scale</span></article></div></section><section class=\"d01-fgroup\"><div class=\"d01-fgroup-head\"><span class=\"d01-fgroup-id\"><b>02</b> · Capability group</span><h2 class=\"d01-fgroup-name\">Locatie<em>intelligentie.</em></h2><p class=\"d01-fgroup-blurb\">GPS-geofencing maakt van één code op elke plek een andere code. Definieer zones, routeer per regio, lever lokale content.</p></div><div class=\"d01-fcards\"><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">04 · Geofence</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">GPS-geofencing</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Definieer virtuele grenzen op basis van straal of polygoon. Routeer anders wanneer scans binnen of buiten de zone plaatsvinden, met nauwkeurigheid op meterniveau.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Radius · Polygon</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">05 · Local</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Locatiegebonden content</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Toon winkels in de buurt, lokale prijzen, regionale aanbiedingen en landingspagina's in de juiste taal. Dezelfde code, direct gelokaliseerd.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Personalised</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">06 · Multi</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Routering voor meerdere locaties</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Eén code per franchise, zonder overhead. Koppel elke scannerlocatie automatisch aan de juiste bestemming; beheer ze centraal.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Franchise · Chain</span></article></div></section><section class=\"d01-fgroup\"><div class=\"d01-fgroup-head\"><span class=\"d01-fgroup-id\"><b>03</b> · Capability group</span><h2 class=\"d01-fgroup-name\">Tijd<em>routering.</em></h2><p class=\"d01-fgroup-blurb\">Tijdstip, dag van de week, kalenderdata. Gedrag dat volgens schema verandert, zonder tussenkomst van mensen.</p></div><div class=\"d01-fcards\"><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">07 · Hours</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Tijdgebaseerde routering</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Verschillende bestemmingen per uur, dag of datumbereik. Brunchmenu vóór 11 uur, diner na 17 uur, aanbieding op zaterdag.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Hours · Days</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">08 · Live</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Directe updates</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Wijzigingen worden binnen een seconde doorgevoerd. Geen CDN-flush, geen rebuild, geen wachten. Publiceer een wijziging en de volgende scan pikt hem op.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Sub-second</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">09 · Schedule</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Campagneplanning</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Stel voor elke code een start- en einddatum in. Lanceer een campagne maandag om 9 uur, beëindig hem zondag om middernacht — zonder handmatige wissel.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Auto · Calendar</span></article></div></section><section class=\"d01-fgroup\"><div class=\"d01-fgroup-head\"><span class=\"d01-fgroup-id\"><b>04</b> · Capability group</span><h2 class=\"d01-fgroup-name\">Analytics <em>en team.</em></h2><p class=\"d01-fgroup-blurb\">Realtime intelligentie, op rollen afgestemde samenwerking, mobile-first levering. Beheer het net als de rest van uw stack.</p></div><div class=\"d01-fcards\"><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">10 · Insight</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Geavanceerde analytics</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Realtime scantracking met locatie, apparaat, browser, tijd en conversie-intelligentie. Heatmaps, funnels, exports, integraties.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Geo · Funnel · Export</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">11 · Team</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Teamsamenwerking</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Nodig teamleden uit met op rollen afgestemde rechten. Activiteitenlogs, goedkeuringen, multi-tenant voor bureaus en franchises.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Roles · Audit</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">12 · Mobile</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Geoptimaliseerd voor mobiel</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Slimme apparaatdetectie, responsieve landingspagina's, snelle eerste weergave. Werkt feilloos op iOS, Android en de rest.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">iOS · Android</span></article></div></section></div><section class=\"d01-fcta\"><div class=\"d01-fcta-inner\"><div><span class=\"d01-fcta-kicker\">D01 / READY</span><h2 class=\"d01-fcta-headline\">Twaalf functies. <em>Eén bewerkbare code.</em></h2></div><div class=\"d01-fcta-actions\"><a class=\"d01-fcta-primary\" href=\"https://app.scanfence.com/signup\">Start gratis proefperiode</a><a class=\"d01-fcta-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">Praat met sales</a></div></div></section>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
